  "description": "Bring familiar LINQ queries to CSV and XLSX files. Work with typed C# objects, stream results, and create or extend CSV files. Select date formats, boolean/null tokens, or your own converters. .NET 10+, Native AOT, and no extra runtime package dependencies.",
