  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Prerelease: BooleanTokens and NullToken annotations select boolean and null text for CSV/XLSX reads and CSV output. Configure ordinal case matching, combine null tokens with nullable boolean/date formats, and preserve empty-string distinctions. Non-null output that collides with a null token throws. Includes a refreshed introduction, LINQ queries, custom converters, exact temporal formats, and sync/async CSV creation, append, and insertion. Native AOT and a BCL-only runtime. API changes remain possible.",
